325
00:21:12,347 --> 00:21:13,607
Çünkü kapitalist sistem

326
00:21:13,607 --> 00:21:15,327
her seferinde

327
00:21:15,327 --> 00:21:16,887
daha çok üretmeyi

328
00:21:16,887 --> 00:21:18,147
